   "tooltip": "<spellPassive>Passive:</spellPassive> Rengar will also leap Attack when <keywordStealth>Camouflaged</keywordStealth>.<br /><br /><spellActive>Active:</spellActive> Rengar gains <speed>{{ stealthms }}% Move Speed</speed> and <keywordStealth>True Sight</keywordStealth> in a small area around the nearest enemy champion for {{ stealthduration }} seconds.<br /><br />After {{ fadetime }} seconds, Rengar becomes <keywordStealth>Camouflaged</keywordStealth> and can leap without being in Brush. Leaping to the nearest champion deals an additional <physicalDamage>{{ bonusdamage }} physical damage</physicalDamage>, shreds <scaleArmor>{{ armorshred }} Armor</scaleArmor> for {{ armorshredduration }} seconds, and ends this Ability.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
